<section class="sustainability section">
  <div class="sustainability__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--neutral sustainability__eyebrow">Environmental Stewardship</span>
    <h2 class="sustainability__title">Celebrate with Love — <em>for Each Other and the Earth.</em></h2>
    <p class="sustainability__body">At Casa Arkaana, every wedding becomes part of a larger story — one where love is celebrated in harmony with the land that holds us. Beneath the trees and under the stars, we honour both people and planet by designing celebrations that leave only joy behind, never waste.</p>
    <p class="sustainability__body">We compost, recycle, and tread lightly, ensuring that what nourishes your wedding also nourishes the Earth. At one jungle wedding, three days of festivities left behind only two small bags of trash — the rest returned to the soil or was given a new life.</p>
    <p class="sustainability__stat">"Here, sustainability is not an add-on —<br>it is woven into the fabric of your celebration."</p>
    <span class="sustainability__line"></span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sustainability {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sustainability__inner {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sustainability__eyebrow {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .sustainability__title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .sustainability__title em { font-style: italic; }

  .sustainability__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--sp-4);
  }

  .sustainability__stat {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sustainability__line {
    display: block;
    width: 40px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
    margin: var(--sp-6) auto 0;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
</style>
